  "title": "ADMT Post-Adverse Explanation Within 30 Days",
  "content": "Beginning January 1, 2027, within 30 days of an adverse consequential decision made using covered automated decision-making technology, the deployer must give the consumer a plain-language explanation covering the AI's role in the decision, its degree of contribution, the types of data processed, and the sources of that data.",
